  "Question": "Let \\(S\\) be the sum of the first nine terms of the sequence\n\n\\[ \\begin{gathered} x+a,\\quad x^2+2a,\\\\ x^3+3a,\\quad\\ldots. \\end{gathered} \\]\n\nThen \\(S\\) equals:",
